1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:07,710
The dealer app shows your whole book: every client account, order and position.

2
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:11,580
Accounts lists every client account with its balance, equity, margin and profit.

3
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:18,010
Under the accounts, the Summary totals open positions by instrument, for the account you select or for all.

4
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:23,430
Rates & Charts shows every instrument with live prices. Here you change prices, spreads and negotiation.

5
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:28,850
Orders holds the pending orders of all traders. The badge counts the ones waiting.

6
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:34,270
Trades lists every open position in the book.

7
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:39,680
Blotter shows the deals done today or this shift, and your result by instrument.

8
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:45,100
Position History lists closed positions.

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:50,520
Events and Message: server events, price alerts, news and the STP logs.

10
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:56,130
Symbol Exposure is your net exposure in each instrument.

11
00:00:56,230 --> 00:01:01,490
This shows whether the market is open. Clicking it closes trading for every trader, so use it with care.

12
00:01:01,590 --> 00:01:04,850
Message sends a note to traders.

13
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:12,140
On the right: profiles, theme, Price Changer, Order Depth and settings.

14
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:16,140
The bar at the bottom shows your dealer account, and switches the blotter between Day and Shift.

